<title>POLAND: Kety surges 10 pct after falls.</title>
<headline>Kety surges 10 pct after falls.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish aluminium plant Kety SA surged 10 percent to 258.5 zlotys in moderate 1.1-million-zloty turnover and analysts said the jump might have been a reaction to last week's six-percent fall.</p>
<p>&quot;It probably reacted to recent falls but the stock often jumps or falls with no reasons,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Some said the growth could have been caused by a foreign investor, who purchased it by one large order.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
